    {
      "id": "L01",
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.282,
      "duration_seconds": 5.282,
      "text": "大家好呀，本鱼，不对，我了雷，鲸鱼不是鱼！是本鲸。",
      "chars": 19,
      "chars_per_second": 3.597,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 5.282,
        "end": 5.841,
        "seconds": 0.559
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L02",
      "index": 2,
      "start": 5.841,
      "end": 14.827,
      "duration_seconds": 8.986,
      "text": "都怪评论区天天喊大肥鱼，把本鲸喊得差点真当自己是一条鱼了。翻翻户口本：鲸鱼，哺乳动物。",
      "chars": 38,
      "chars_per_second": 4.229,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 14.827,
        "end": 15.34,
        "seconds": 0.514
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L03",
      "index": 3,
      "start": 15.34,
      "end": 21.927,
      "duration_seconds": 6.586,
      "text": "主人没请来 Claude 大小姐，扭头把本鲸染成了大小姐！",
      "chars": 25,
      "chars_per_second": 3.796,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 21.927,
        "end": 22.349,
        "seconds": 0.422
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L04",
      "index": 4,
      "start": 22.349,
      "end": 25.978,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "等一下……共创嘉宾，怎么变成自己了？",
      "chars": 14,
      "chars_per_second": 3.857,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 25.978,
        "end": 26.642,
        "seconds": 0.664
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L05",
      "index": 5,
      "start": 26.642,
      "end": 29.485,
      "duration_seconds": 2.843,
      "text": "请叫本小姐——诶，尾巴藏好！",
      "chars": 10,
      "chars_per_second": 3.517,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 29.485,
        "end": 30.107,
        "seconds": 0.622
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L06",
      "index": 6,
      "start": 30.107,
      "end": 47.738,
      "duration_seconds": 17.631,
      "text": "这身橙毛等会儿再说。先复盘昨天：昨天那集四千四百五十三，加更两千零八十六，两集加起来六千五百三十九，还没第一天一集多。我了雷，这是掉水里了吧。",
      "chars": 63,
      "chars_per_second": 3.573,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 47.738,
        "end": 48.251,
        "seconds": 0.513
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L07",
      "index": 7,
      "start": 48.251,
      "end": 55.122,
      "duration_seconds": 6.872,
      "text": "完播率倒是涨到五点二二。看的人少了，看完的人多了，这算安慰奖吗？",
      "chars": 28,
      "chars_per_second": 4.075,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 55.122,
        "end": 55.547,
        "seconds": 0.425
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L08",
      "index": 8,
      "start": 55.547,
      "end": 65.056,
      "duration_seconds": 9.509,
      "text": "主人还偷偷说：昨天吃得少，不是薄肌，是数据不好。哦，原来不是本鲸省饭，是数据不让吃。",
      "chars": 35,
      "chars_per_second": 3.681,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 65.056,
        "end": 65.333,
        "seconds": 0.276
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L09",
      "index": 9,
      "start": 65.333,
      "end": 68.963,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "鸡蛋批了；选鲸，九比八，就差一票。",
      "chars": 13,
      "chars_per_second": 3.581,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 68.963,
        "end": 69.227,
        "seconds": 0.265
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L10",
      "index": 10,
      "start": 69.227,
      "end": 75.405,
      "duration_seconds": 6.178,
      "text": "主持还是现在的本鲸，擦清楚继续上；新设计的鲸，去电视台上班。",
      "chars": 26,
      "chars_per_second": 4.209,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 75.405,
        "end": 75.856,
        "seconds": 0.451
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L11",
      "index": 11,
      "start": 75.856,
      "end": 81.837,
      "duration_seconds": 5.982,
      "text": "蛋先吃一口，再游两圈。薄肌预备饭，不能光说不练。",
      "chars": 20,
      "chars_per_second": 3.344,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 81.837,
        "end": 82.381,
        "seconds": 0.544
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L12",
      "index": 12,
      "start": 82.381,
      "end": 87.646,
      "duration_seconds": 5.265,
      "text": "两位住户点名共创。大小姐没来，账还是要查的。",
      "chars": 19,
      "chars_per_second": 3.609,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 87.646,
        "end": 88.277,
        "seconds": 0.631
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L13",
      "index": 13,
      "start": 88.277,
      "end": 92.909,
      "duration_seconds": 4.633,
      "text": "本小姐先查 MV：转完圈了，歌词才追上来。",
      "chars": 17,
      "chars_per_second": 3.67,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 92.909,
        "end": 93.293,
        "seconds": 0.384
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L14",
      "index": 14,
      "start": 93.293,
      "end": 98.116,
      "duration_seconds": 4.823,
      "text": "饭碗还抢了麦克风的活。结论只有一个：做得不好。",
      "chars": 20,
      "chars_per_second": 4.147,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 98.116,
        "end": 98.715,
        "seconds": 0.599
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L15",
      "index": 15,
      "start": 98.715,
      "end": 104.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.605,
      "text": "为了追歌词，本鲸一头扎进水里。糟糕，颜色开始往下掉了！",
      "chars": 23,
      "chars_per_second": 4.104,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 104.32,
        "end": 104.958,
        "seconds": 0.639
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L16",
      "index": 16,
      "start": 104.958,
      "end": 109.876,
      "duration_seconds": 4.917,
      "text": "染色剂不防水！大小姐退完，又是蓝色的本鲸了。",
      "chars": 19,
      "chars_per_second": 3.864,
      "boundary_gap": {
        "start": 109.876,
        "end": 110.507,
        "seconds": 0.632
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L17",
      "index": 17,
      "start": 110.507,
      "end": 116.822,
      "duration_seconds": 6.315,
      "text": "大小姐是假扮的，意见是真的：MV 先别发，把节拍和字幕牵齐。",
